  "name": "Mobile Kanban chat view overlay",
  "pinned": false,
  "description": "Here's a 5-line summary:\n\n1. The goal is to make the Kanban board mobile-friendly by showing a `ChatView` overlay instead of navigating away when a task is tapped on mobile.\n2. The `openChat` method in `Kanban.vue` was modified to check `$ui.isMobile` and set a `mobileActiveChat` data property instead of calling `setActiveChat`.\n3. A `mobileActiveChat` data property was added to track which chat is currently open in the mobile overlay.\n4. A full-screen overlay div was added to the template that renders `ChatView` inside it when `mobileActiveChat` is set, with a back button to close it.\n5. Two helper methods, `openMobileChat` and `closeMobileChat`, were added to handle navigation between chats and dismissal of the overlay from within the `ChatView`.",
